  "description": "The Black Lava 3 – the high-end touring bike on a whole new level. The lightweight aluminium frame with polished weld seams combines sporty elegance with a sophisticated design down to the smallest detail. The asymmetrically carbon performance fork weighs less than 500 g and also offers the practical option of attaching front panniers. The high-quality Rohloff Speedhub 14-speed hub gear in combination with the low-noise Gates Carbon Drive belt ensure maximum efficiency with minimum maintenance. Internally routed cables, integrated mudguards and a sturdy luggage rack round off the features and give the Black Lava 3 an unmistakable look and a high level of everyday practicality. Powerful front and rear lights guarantee maximum visibility at any time of day. ¹ approx. 16.2 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for All Black frame, size 19\", without pedals.",
